", "title" => "Hit radius (units)", "type" => "string", "validation" => %{"pattern" => "^-?[0-9]+(\\.[0-9]+)?$"}}, %{"description" => "Damage dealt to the player on hit/detonation. projectile_types.gd MISSILE_DAMAGE 80.0 / LASER_DAMAGE 80.0. Thrown grenade is player-side (GRENADE_DETONATE_DAMAGE 450.0 to enemies).", "name" => "damage", "title" => "Damage to player", "type" => "string", "validation" => %{"pattern" => "^-?[0-9]+(\\.[0-9]+)?$"}}, %{"description" => "True if the player can shoot the projectile down. Missiles carry MISSILE_BASE_HP (60) + a fat collision sphere; lasers cannot be destroyed.", "name" => "destroyable", "title" => "Destroyable (shootable)", "type" => "boolean"}, %{"description" => "The visual effect this projectile renders with (tint / trail / halo).", "name" => "vfx", "refType" => "vfx", "title" => "VFX", "type" => "reference"}], false, "document", [], "production", [], "send", [], "private", [], [], %{"kind" => "homing"}, [], %{}, %{}, false, %{}, ~U[2026-10-13 19:47:24.200359Z], ~U[2026-10-13 19:47:24.200359Z], "62d102a8-af03-4d3e-b5e1-32ed22aa652e"]
