ve-in-floor positions where a boss occupies the slot (4, 7, 10 in the Godot wave_manager). The boss-wave rows in the enemy personality matrix are inert filler — the boss takes over at these positions.", "name" => "spawnsOnWaves", "of" => %{"title" => "Wave", "type" => "string", "validation" => %{"pattern" => "^[0-9]+$"}}, "ordered" => true, "title" => "Spawns on waves", "type" => "arrayOf"}, %{"description" => "True only for the King — killing it unlocks the next floor (BossTypes.unlocks_floor returns true for KING).", "name" => "unlocksFloor", "title" => "Unlocks floor", "type" => "boolean"}, %{"description" => "Wind-up tell shape the boss shares across abilities. The fair-tell band sits at 0.5-1.0s in the port; longer durations read as heavier commits.", "fields" => [%{"description" => "Seconds the boss winds up before a telegraphed ability fires. boss.gd TELEGRAPH_DURATION baseline.", "name" => "duration", "title" => "Duration (s)", "type" => "string", "validation" => %{"pattern" => "^-?[0-9]+(\\.[0-9]+)?$"}}, %{"description" => "Whether the body emits the ramping per-ability tint during the wind-up (orange missiles / red lasers / gold royal-decree).", "name" => "glow", "title" => "Glow", "type" => "boolean"}, %{"description" => "Whether the body swells in scale across the telegraph as part of the wind-up read.", "name" => "scaleSwell", "title" => "Scale swell", "type" => "boolean"}], "name" => "telegraph", "title" => "Telegraph", "type" => "composite"}, %{"description" => "The abilities this royal's arbiter can fire. References into the bossAbility collection. Order is the arbiter priority hint (missiles > lasers in the source).", "name" => "abilities", "of" => %{"refType" => "bossAbility", "title" => "Ability", "type" => "reference"}, "ordered" => true, "title" => "Abilities", "type" => "arrayOf"}], false, "document", [], "db91ad5f-3bbe-498d-8ed8-9764a8959396", "d08684a3-edfe-411c-aa4a-2b592f46269b", "production", [], "user", [], "148a5cbb-ead3-44c7-a5e5-fb0b3f15cb91", "private", [], [], %{"prestigeValue" => "70", "rank" => "1", "slug" => "prince", "spawnsOnWaves" => ["4", "7", "10"], "statBlock" => %{"damage" => "45", "hp" => "4200"}, "telegraph" => %{"duration" => "0.5", "glow" => true, "scaleSwell" => false}, "title" => "Prince", "unlocksFloor" => false}, [], %{}, %{}, false, %{}, ~U[2026-10-13 19:47:24.209278Z], ~U[2026-10-13 19:47:24.209278Z], "6545c2b1-341a-444a-b22b-fb3002108a4b"]
