97bd-02b75f5f2675", "4e1501cc-8465-45a2-ac87-c0bb4742d5ed", "Title in original language", "Where the subject of the ONIX record is a translated item", "eng", ~U[2026-10-13 19:47:24.747600Z], ~U[2026-10-13 19:47:24.747600Z], "2592109f-9d52-4d04-8833-66fcaaa1b944", "d14835ac-0108-4d9d-af72-37918588e4c7", "Title acronym or initialism", "For serials: an acronym or initialism of Title Type 01, eg ‘JAMA’, ‘JACM’", "eng", ~U[2026-10-13 19:47:24.747600Z], ~U[2026-10-13 19:47:24.747600Z], "4dfe201f-e672-45d4-b7db-d6a1a54ace5e", "0953127f-380c-4c43-ac47-5b42858d4af6", "Abbreviated title", "An abbreviated form of Title Type 01", "eng", ~U[2026-10-13 19:47:24.747600Z], ~U[2026-10-13 19:47:24.747600Z], "28362c55-fd3b-43a0-b0fc-5704faf61a06", "2d5e9cca-d72e-49bf-a145-1a0b54780434", "Title in other language", "A translation of Title Type 01 or 03, or an independent title, used when the work is translated into another language, sometimes termed a ‘parallel title’", "eng", ~U[2026-10-13 19:47:24.747600Z], ~U[2026-10-13 19:47:24.747600Z], "00263d6e-4527-4334-8d30-a223a95c1c14", "f7e695f8-d855-49cc-99a6-ebe33f5d9b66", ...]
